	"It looks like there were issues with BlockEra Launcher connecting to Microsoft's servers. This is often the result of a poor connection, so we recommend trying again to see if it works. If issues continue to persist, follow the steps in": "blockera.ui.0951c9cfadf4",
	"BlockEra Launcher tried to connect to Microsoft / Xbox / Minecraft services, but the remote server rejected the connection. This may indicate that these services are blocked by the hosts file. Please visit": "blockera.ui.b6a5b59cb7ba",
	"It looks like BlockEra Launcher is unable to write to the directory you selected. Please adjust the permissions of the directory and try again or cancel the directory change.": "blockera.ui.94f7df82f77c",
	"It looks like there is not enough space on the disk containing the directory you selected. Please free up some space and try again or cancel the directory change.": "blockera.ui.e8609c4f76c6",
	"BlockEra Launcher is unable to migrate to the new directory you selected. Please contact support for help or cancel the directory change.": "blockera.ui.471d0f52b386",
	"To play this instance, you must sign in through Microsoft below. If you don't have a Minecraft account, you can purchase the game on the": "blockera.ui.81d29ff5cd35",
	"BlockEra Launcher failed to load correctly. This may be because of a corrupted file, or because the app is missing crucial files.": "blockera.ui.efb4051db259",
	"and start a chat using the widget in the bottom right and we will be more than happy to assist! Make sure to provide the following debug information to the agent:": "blockera.ui.3a75e1310eef",
	"⚠️ Migration Issue • Important Notice": "blockera.ui.cf1ac793741a",
	"We've detected a problem with our database migration system caused by inconsistent line endings between operating systems (Windows vs. macOS/Linux). This may affect app stability.": "blockera.ui.b931cddd4a11",
	"What’s happening?": "blockera.ui.617696c8133e",
	"Our migration validator misreads modified migrations when line endings differ (CRLF ↔ LF), which can make the app unusable.": "blockera.ui.206a57f9baad",
	"Why?": "blockera.ui.d77989c1e3c0",
	"Git’s automatic line-ending conversions and OS differences can cause these inconsistencies during builds.": "blockera.ui.cea1024f4105",
	"What’s next?": "blockera.ui.bca70bf7a9fa",
	"We’re working on a permanent fix. In the meantime, you can apply one of the quick fixes below depending on your system.": "blockera.ui.b0afbfcb925b",
	"Do I need to apply a fix now?": "blockera.ui.8a49d2b769ee",
	"If you're encountering an error while applying migrations, such as \"Error while applying migrations: migration XXXXXXXXXX was previously applied but has been modified\", or a similar issue with migration, the following actions might help:": "blockera.ui.590a977f879d",
	"If none of the above steps help, you can try saving a copy of the file": "blockera.ui.af199f0f220c",
	"to a safe location, such as": "blockera.ui.34847c4c35c4",
	"on Windows or": "blockera.ui.31d066ed215e",
	"on macOS, then deleting the original file and letting the app re-create the database file. Note that this may cause data loss inside the app, so make sure to back up your launcher data before applying this fixes.": "blockera.ui.7c829d26d870",
	"Apply fix for Unix like systems (Debian, Ubuntu, macOS and others)": "blockera.ui.4a0880ea8254",
	"Apply fix for Windows": "blockera.ui.66d05094e407",
	"✅ The migration fix has been applied successfully. Please restart the launcher and try to log in to the game :)": "blockera.ui.964071606403",
	"If the problem persists, please try the other fix.": "blockera.ui.cf24c9e25b78",
	"❌ The migration fix failed or had no effect.": "blockera.ui.bab90054367c",
